category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "C++ I/O library for WorldForge clients/servers (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "skstream is an iotream C++ socket library and is recommended for use as a
transport for Atlas-C++. It is capable of creating iostream-based socket
connections for both clients and servers."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/worldforge/skstream
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
